During migration (2 Redis instances): ~$260–$300/month

Post-consolidation (1 Redis instance): ~$130–$150/month

Expected saving: ~$130–$150/month after consolidation

2. Azure Flexible PostgreSQL Migration

Observation: Current Burstable SKU shows performance limitations.
Microsoft Recommendation: Move to General Purpose SKU for improved stability.

Action Plan:

Work with DBA team to migrate Dev and UAT first, then extend to Prod and CPro.

Estimated Cost (Azure UK South):

Tier	vCore	Approx. Monthly Cost (USD)
Burstable (B2s)	2 vCores / 4 GB	$70–$90
General Purpose (GP2)	2 vCores / 8 GB	$180–$220
General Purpose (GP4)	4 vCores / 16 GB	$260–$320

Incremental cost: ~$100–$150/month per DB

Benefit: Consistent performance and scalability

Next Steps:

Deploy Redis 6 & 7 in Dev/UAT → move to Prod.

Begin PostgreSQL SKU migration (Dev/UAT → Prod → CPro).

Plan Redis 7 code consolidation post-migration for cost optimization.

